A ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/metalanguage.td")} notation for specifying ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/context-free.td")} grammars, using production rules of the form $\text{<nonterminal>} ::= \text{expression}$ to define the syntax of formal languages.
